     1,
     "<div>Hi everyone -</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve recently implemented violin plots and dot plots for ggplot2. Here&#39;s a sampling of what you can do with them:</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/4987086eddc95308/violin-nofullwidth.png?part=0.1\" alt=\"violin-nofullwidth.png\" title=\"violin-nofullwidth.png\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/4987086eddc95308/violin-boxplot.png?part=0.2\" alt=\"violin-boxplot.png\" title=\"violin-boxplot.png\"><br>\n\n</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/4987086eddc95308/dotplot.png?part=0.3\" alt=\"dotplot.png\" title=\"dotplot.png\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/4987086eddc95308/dotplot-y-groupx-violin.png?part=0.4\" alt=\"dotplot-y-groupx-violin.png\" title=\"dotplot-y-groupx-violin.png\"><br>\n\n</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>For more information, see:</div><div><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_dotplot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_dotplot&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792377475495000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GZtE5bjm8edzRueMAzhwg\">https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_dotplot</a></font></div>\n\n<div><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_violin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_violin&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792377475495000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QVWYFIS9He3v8o8Aw6MQ0\">https://github.com/wch/ggplot2/wiki/geom_violin</a></font></div><div><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br>\n\n</font></div><div><br></div><div>If you want to try them out, you can install this development branch <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial;font-size:small\">without interfering with your regular installation of ggplot2:</span></div>\n\n<div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">install.packages(&quot;devtools&quot;)</font></div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">library(devtools)</font></div>\n\n<div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">dev_mode()</font></div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">install_github(&quot;ggplot2&quot;, &quot;wch&quot;, &quot;feature/wdotplot&quot;)</font></div>\n\n<div><br></div><div>In each R session where you want to use this version, just run:</div><div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">library(devtools)</font></div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">dev_mode()</font></div>\n\n</div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">library(ggplot2)</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To use your regular ggplot2 installation, just restart R.</font></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I&#39;m still working on these things, so keep in mind that they may change (and break) in the near future.</span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\n\nFeedback is welcome!</div></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">-Winston</span></div>\n"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
